3	/**
4	 * Derives an owner's canonical region ('locality') from its city. The city-to-region
5	 * table lives on {@link Region}; this resolver turns the resolved region into the
6	 * {@code locality} string an owner is mapped with, using {@link #UNKNOWN} for a city
7	 * that belongs to no known region. Kept out of {@link OwnerMapper} so MapStruct does not
8	 * mistake it for an implicit {@code String -> String} property mapping method.
